            "review_title": "Review at Ciel",
            "review_text": "harlemfamily\nNew York City, New York829 contributions\n0\nExceptional food experience\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe had a spectacular dinner here while visiting Ho Chi Men City. Easily our best meal in Vietnam. There are 16 courses - some are small bites so we were able to manage the food. Some real highlights... the oyster, the passion fruit and fish roe, the drunken chicken, and especially the kailaan with foie gras, scallop and cheese sauce. The wine pairings were exceptional all high quality wines. The service was exceptional. We enjoyed the counter experience so that we could watch the food preparation. However, we were horrified by most of the other diners - who were on their phones the whole time and did not seem very interested in the food - one was even reading a book during the entire meal. This is of course not the restaurant's fault, but did diminish our experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 25, 2026",
