            "review_text": "maipenraiz\nSingapore, Singapore53 contributions\n0\nOne of the best restaurants in Asia, if not the world\nJun 2025 • Couples\nAll I can say is - “A culinary triumph!” \n\nCiel is only 8 months old and already awarded a Michelin star, just 2 weeks ago. \n\nMy prediction is they will earn 2 stars within 3 years, and 3 stars within 10.\n\nThe food, service and ambience was uniformly excellent. The level of service exceeded anything I have experienced in fine dining in North America, Europe, Japan and Thailand. \n\nChef Le has staged at several Michelin 3 stars across Europe, including Noma. Maitre’d Liem chose sublime and unique wine pairings. The two of them co-founded the restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2025",
